            "body": "The Greyhaven caravan vanished near the Ashen Wilds three nights ago, with eleven wagons, forty souls and a strongbox sealed by the guild itself. Garrick swears the drivers knew the road blind; the last waystation saw them pass at dusk, lanterns lit, singing. Since then nothing: no wreck, no tracks off the road, no ransom note. The guild offers two hundred gold for news and five hundred for the strongbox, unopened. Find what happened, recover what can be recovered and report back to Garrick before the guild sends its own people, who are less patient and far less kind.",
